---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy Policy | Alvarado Investments">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container narrow prose">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

      <h2>Alvarado Investments Privacy Policy</h2>
      <p>
        At Alvarado Investments, we are committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy
        Policy explains how we collect, use, and disclose your personal information when you
        visit our website or engage with our services.
      </p>

      <h2>Collection of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        When you visit our website, we may collect certain personal information, such as your
        name, email address, and contact details. We collect this information to provide you
        with the best possible service and to respond to your inquiries.
      </p>

      <h2>Use of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>We may use your personal information to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
        <li>Communicate with you about your inquiries or requests</li>
        <li>Send you relevant updates and newsletters</li>
        <li>Analyze and understand how our website is being used</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Disclosure of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        We may disclose your personal information to third-party service providers who assist
        us in delivering our services and operating our website. These providers are
        contractually bound to protect your information and may only use it for the purposes
        for which we disclose it to them.
      </p>

      <h2>Security of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        We take reasonable measures to protect your personal information from unauthorized
        access, use, or disclosure. However, please be aware that no method of transmission
        over the internet or electronic storage is completely secure.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention of Personal Information</h2>
      <p>
        We will retain your personal information for as long as necessary to fulfill the
        purposes for which it was collected, or as required by law.
      </p>

      <h2>Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        You have the right to access, update, or delete your personal information. If you
        would like to exercise any of these rights, please contact us using the information
        provided below.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions or concerns about our Privacy Policy, please contact me at
        josephalvarado85@gmail.com.
      </p>
      <p><em>This Privacy Policy was last updated on 9/22/2023.</em></p>

      <h1 style="margin-top: 4rem;">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>

      <h2>Alvarado Investments Terms and Conditions for Contact Form</h2>
      <p>
        By submitting the contact form on the Alvarado Investments website, you agree to the
        following terms and conditions:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Personal Information:</strong> When filling out the contact form, you may be
          required to provide personal information such as your name, email address, and phone
          number. Alvarado Investments will collect and process this information in accordance
          with its Privacy Policy.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Purpose of Contact:</strong> The information submitted through the contact
          form will be used solely for the purpose of responding to your inquiry or request
          for information about Alvarado Investments' services.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Consent to Communication:</strong> By submitting the contact form, you
          consent to being contacted by Alvarado Investments via the provided email address or
          phone number for the purpose of responding to your inquiry or request.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Confidentiality:</strong> Alvarado Investments will treat all information
          submitted through the contact form as confidential. However, please be aware that
          the internet is not entirely secure, and Alvarado Investments cannot guarantee the
          security of your information during transmission.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Use of Information:</strong> Alvarado Investments will use the information
          submitted through the contact form only to address your inquiry or request. Your
          information will not be used for any other purpose without your explicit consent.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Third-Party Disclosure:</strong> Alvarado Investments may need to disclose
          the information submitted through the contact form to third-party service providers
          who assist in managing and responding to inquiries. These providers are obligated to
          protect your information and use it only for the purpose for which it was disclosed.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Retention of Information:</strong> Alvarado Investments will retain the
          information submitted through the contact form for as long as necessary to fulfill
          the purpose for which it was collected, or as required by law.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Right to Access and Update Information:</strong> You have the right to
          access and update the personal information you have provided through the contact
          form. If you would like to exercise this right, please contact Alvarado Investments
          using the contact information provided below.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Changes to Terms and Conditions:</strong> Alvarado Investments reserves the
          right to modify or update these terms and conditions for the contact form at any
          time. It is your responsibility to review these terms and conditions periodically
          for any changes.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Governing Law:</strong> These terms and conditions for the contact form
          shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the jurisdiction
          where Alvarado Investments operates.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        If you do not agree with these terms and conditions, please refrain from submitting
        the contact form. If you have any questions or concerns about these terms and
        conditions, please contact Alvarado Investments using the information provided below.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact Information</h2>
      <p>Email: josephalvarado85@gmail.com</p>
      <p>
        <em>These Terms and Conditions for the Contact Form were last updated on 9/22/2023.</em>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .narrow {
    max-width: 820px;
  }
</style>
